The Company understands that the competition in the acquisition of contracts in the construction industry is very tight. However, with its expertise and experience, the Company believes it has a strong position in the competition. It is mainly supported by the competitive advantage of the Company, including a very competitive cost structure, skilled workforce, as well as specific experience of the Company in certain types of projects, such as construction of airports.

